at can be filled with an element with {{spell,25931,1::Alchemical Rhetoric}}.\nWhen the flask is attacked by an ally, the ally consumes its contents so that the caster heals them and increases their characteristics based on the contents.\nWhen it is destroyed, the flask inflicts damage based on its contents on enemies and on the caster's other flasks in an area of effect.\n\nOn one of the caster's full flasks: consumes the flask's contents.\nOn one of the caster's empty flasks: destroys the flask and reimburses the AP cost.\n\nUsing the spell on a flask reimburses the use of the spell on the current turn."},{"id":25742,"name":"Stimulating Word","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12863-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":3,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":2,"max":2,"kind":"ap_gain"}]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":4,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":2,"max":2,"kind":"ap_gain"}]},{"grade":3,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":2,"max":2,"kind":"ap_gain"}]}],"description":"Increases the targeted ally's AP and applies the Encouraged state on the ally.\nStacking is shared among Encouragements.\n\nOn a free cell: summons a Stimulating Fairy."},{"id":25746,"name":"Word of Decline","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12898-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":75,"max":0,"kind":"heal_mod"}],"buffs":["Effect duration: -1"]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":5,"maxPerTurn":1,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":75,"max":0,"kind":"heal_mod"}],"buffs":["Effect duration: -1"]}],"description":"Reduces the duration of effects on the targeted enemy, reduces its healing received, and applies the Mocked state on it.\nStacking is 